sequenceDiagram
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant CM as ConfigMap Controller
    participant HPA as HPA Controller
    participant IP as InferencePool Controller
    participant SO as ScaledObject Controller
    participant Coord as Coordinator /<br/>Optimization Engine
    participant Kalman as Kalman Filter<br/>Predictor
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Actuator as Direct Actuator
    participant Target as Deployment / LWS<br/>Scale Subresource

    Note over CM,SO: Startup: Controller-runtime initializes informers

    %% ConfigMap bootstrap
    rect rgb(229, 232, 212)
        Note over CM,K8sAPI: Configuration Bootstrap
        K8sAPI->>CM: ConfigMap watch event<br/>SA: controller-manager
        CM->>CM: Bootstrap initial state<br/>Propagate config to datastore
        CM-->>K8sAPI: Status update
    end

    %% HPA/InferencePool/ScaledObject discovery
    rect rgb(212, 232, 229)
        Note over HPA,SO: Target Discovery (parallel loops)
        K8sAPI->>HPA: HPA watch event<br/>autoscaling/v2
        K8sAPI->>IP: InferencePool watch event<br/>inference.networking.k8s.io
        K8sAPI->>SO: ScaledObject watch event<br/>keda.sh/v1alpha1 (conditional)
        HPA->>Coord: Register scaling target
        IP->>Coord: Register pool target
        SO->>Coord: Register KEDA target
    end

    %% Metrics collection and scaling decision
    rect rgb(255, 242, 204)
        Note over Coord,Prom: Metrics Collection Loop
        Coord->>Prom: Query saturation metrics<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / mTLS<br/>TLS 1.2+ minimum
        Prom-->>Coord: Metric values<br/>(saturation data)
        Coord->>Kalman: Feed metrics for prediction
        Kalman-->>Coord: Predicted scaling action<br/>(Kalman filter output)
    end

    %% Scaling action
    rect rgb(248, 206, 204)
        Note over Coord,Target: Scaling Execution
        Coord->>Actuator: Execute scaling decision
        Actuator->>K8sAPI: PATCH autoscaling/v1/Scale<br/>SA: controller-manager<br/>RBAC: manager-role
        K8sAPI->>Target: Update replica count
        Target-->>K8sAPI: Scale confirmed
        K8sAPI-->>Actuator: 200 OK
    end

    %% Observability
    rect rgb(225, 213, 231)
        Note over K8sAPI: Observability
        Note right of Actuator: :8443/metrics (TokenReview + SAR)<br/>:8081/healthz (unauthenticated)<br/>:8081/readyz (unauthenticated)
    end
